'''Chainmail armor''' is a type of [[armor]] that cannot be crafted. It is the fourth strongest armor, between [[Iron Armor|iron]] and [[Golden Armor|gold]].

== List of items ==
* {{ItemLink|Chainmail Helmet}}
* {{ItemLink|Chainmail Chestplate}}
* {{ItemLink|Chainmail Leggings}}
* {{ItemLink|Chainmail Boots}}

== Obtaining ==
Unlike other armor, chainmail armor cannot be crafted.

=== Generated loot ===
{{LootChestItem|chainmail-helmet,chainmail-chestplate,chainmail-leggings,chainmail-boots}}

=== Mob loot ===
[[Zombie]]s, [[husk]]s, [[zombie villager]]s, [[skeleton]]s, [[stray]]s, [[bogged]], and [[piglin]]s have a chance to spawn with armor, with a 	9.73% chance of it being chainmail armor. If killed by a [[player]], there is an 8.5% chance of dropping the armor. The dropped armor has a random [[durability]] and retains any enchantments it has.

=== Trading ===
{{main|Trading}}
Chainmail armor can be bought from [[armorer]]s.
{{Trade sources|Chainmail Helmet|Chainmail Chestplate|Chainmail Leggings|Chainmail Boots}}

=== Villager gifts ===
{{exclusive|java|section=1}}
[[Armorer]] villagers may give players with the [[Hero of the Village]] effect chainmail armor.

== Usage ==
{{main|Armor#Usage}}
Wearing chainmail armor reduces damage taken from [[Armor#Damage types|most damage types]].

